### Delegations / Notifications
### ------------------------------------------------------------------------

### Delegations
GET {{service}}/Delegations?$top=50&$orderby=createdAt desc
Authorization: Basic {{adminUser}} {{adminPassword}}

### Create delegation
POST {{service}}/Delegations
Authorization: Basic {{adminUser}} {{adminPassword}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "delegator": "alex.johnson@flowmate.demo",
  "delegate": "priya.sharma@flowmate.demo",
  "startDate": "2026-06-29",
  "endDate": "2026-07-05",
  "forwardNotifications": true,
  "enabled": true,
  "createdOnBehalf": true
}

### Resolve notification recipient
POST {{service}}/resolveNotificationRecipient
Authorization: Basic {{user}} {{userPassword}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": "alex.johnson@flowmate.demo"
}

### Resolve task notification recipient
POST {{service}}/resolveTaskNotificationRecipient
Authorization: Basic {{user}} {{userPassword}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "taskId": "{{taskId}}"
}

### Resolve task team notification recipients
POST {{service}}/resolveTaskTeamNotificationRecipients
Authorization: Basic {{user}} {{userPassword}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "taskId": "{{taskId}}"
}

### Resolve involved party notification recipient
POST {{service}}/resolveInvolvedPartyNotificationRecipient
Authorization: Basic {{user}} {{userPassword}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "partyId": "{{partyId}}"
}


