### ------------------------------------------------------------------------
### Delete Examples - use carefully
### ------------------------------------------------------------------------

### Delete task
DELETE {{service}}/ProcessTasks(guid'{{taskId}}')
Authorization: Basic {{adminUser}} {{adminPassword}}

### Delete request
DELETE {{service}}/ProcessRequests(guid'{{requestId}}')
Authorization: Basic {{adminUser}} {{adminPassword}}
